{
  "key": 39269,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_rock",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You made it to Pewter!\r",
        "We met in Oak’s lab, but here I’m a Gym\n",
        "Leader, and you’re a challenger.\r",
        "Show me what your Rock Pokémon can do!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_normal",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Good to see you again.\r",
        "Since Oak’s lab, I’ve wondered how your\n",
        "Normal types would do against my Rock\f",
        "types.\r",
        "Let’s find out!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_water",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Well, well. The kid from Oak’s lab.\r",
        "A Water trainer, here to take the Water\n",
        "Gym’s Badge? Ha!\r",
        "Let’s see you try!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_electric",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Ten-hut! The Electric kid\n",
        "from Oak’s lab!\r",
        "This is my turf, soldier. Let’s see who’s\n",
        "packing more voltage!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_steel",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: The Steel kid! Told you I’d be\n",
        "watching.\r",
        "Let’s see if that armor holds up under\n",
        "fire!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_grass",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}… Welcome. I’m so\n",
        "glad you came.\r",
        "I’ve been looking forward to seeing your\n",
        "Grass Pokémon again.\r",
        "Shall we?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_poison",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: …You have come, as I knew you\n",
        "would.\r",
        "I have watched you from the shadows\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Now show me your Poison in the open!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_bug",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! The Bug trainer from\n",
        "Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Most call Bug Pokémon weak. Show me why\n",
        "they are wrong!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_psychic",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: …I saw this battle in a vision,\n",
        "the day we met in Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Two Psychic trainers. Only one leaves\n",
        "with the win."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_fairy",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: We meet again, as I said we\n",
        "would.\r",
        "Show me whether your Fairy Pokémon\n",
        "trust you as much as I foresaw."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_fire",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! Quiz! Who’s the Fire trainer\n",
        "I met in Oak’s lab?\r",
        "Answer: you! Now let’s see if you can\n",
        "take the heat!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "So, you’re here. I’m Brock.\n",
        "I’m Pewter’s Gym Leader.\r",
        "My rock-hard willpower is evident\n",
        "even in my Pokémon.\r",
        "My Pokémon are all rock hard, and\n",
        "have true-grit determination.\r",
        "That’s right - my Pokémon are all\n",
        "the Rock type!\r",
        "Fuhaha! You’re going to challenge\n",
        "me knowing that you’ll lose?\r",
        "That’s the Trainer’s honor that\n",
        "compels you to challenge me.\r",
        "Fine, then!\n",
        "Show me your best!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_PewterCity_Gym_Text_LetMeTakeYouToTheTop",
      "en_US": [
        "Hiya!\n",
        "Do you want to dream big?\r",
        "Do you dare to dream of becoming\n",
        "the Pokémon champ?\r",
        "I’m no Trainer, but I can advise\n",
        "you on how to win.\r",
        "Let me take you to the top!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_GymAides_Text_PewterCity",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi! I’m one of Prof. Oak’s Aides.\n",
        "He sent us to every Gym with tips\f",
        "for future Gym Leaders.\r",
        "Tip one: a Gym is a path from the\n",
        "door to the Leader. Brock lines his\f",
        "Trainers up so you must face them.\r",
        "In your own Gym, challengers walk\n",
        "from the door to your Battle Stage.\r",
        "Gym Walls and Statues shape that\n",
        "walk. Make it feel like a journey!\r",
        "And see the rocks? A Gym’s look\n",
        "should shout its type!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_PewterCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue",
      "en_US": [
        "Pewter Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Brock\r",
        "Winning Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_PewterCity_Gym_Text_YoureChampMaterial",
      "en_US": [
        "Just as I thought!\n",
        "You’re Pokémon champ material!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_PewterCity_Gym_Text_LetsGetHappening",
      "en_US": [
        "All right!\n",
        "Let’s get happening!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_PewterCity_Gym_Text_ItsFreeLetsGetHappening",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a free service!\n",
        "Let’s get happening!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_GymAides_Text_PewterCityAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "You beat Brock! Remember:\n",
        "challengers walk the path you build.\r",
        "Put your Battle Stage at the end of\n",
        "a long, grand hall, and every\f",
        "challenger feels the pressure!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_PewterCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon",
      "en_US": [
        "Pewter Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Brock\r",
        "Winning Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "There are all kinds of Trainers in\n",
        "this huge world of ours.\r",
        "You appear to be very gifted as a\n",
        "Pokémon Trainer.\r",
        "So let me make a suggestion.\r",
        "Go to the Gym in Cerulean and test\n",
        "your abilities."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_PewterCity_Gym_Text_TakeThisWithYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Wait!\n",
        "Take this with you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_PewterCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM39FromBrock",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received TM39\n",
        "from Brock."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_PewterCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM39",
      "en_US": [
        "A TM, Technical Machine, contains a\n",
        "technique for Pokémon.\r",
        "Using a TM teaches the move it\n",
        "contains to a Pokémon.\r",
        "A TM is good for only one use.\r",
        "So, when you use one, pick the\n",
        "Pokémon carefully.\r",
        "Anyways…\n",
        "TM39 contains Rock Tomb.\r",
        "It hurls boulders at the foe and\n",
        "lowers its Speed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_PewterCity_Gym_Text_TryDifferentPartyOrders",
      "en_US": [
        "The first Pokémon out in a match is\n",
        "at the left of the Pokémon List.\r",
        "By changing the order of Pokémon,\n",
        "you may gain an advantage.\r",
        "Try different orders to suit your\n",
        "opponent’s party."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_GymHack_Text_BrockSilverCap",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: One more thing.\r",
        "The League sends every Gym a few of\n",
        "these for promising challengers.\r",
        "Prof. Oak told us about the new\n",
        "Gym. I’d say you qualify."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_GymHack_Text_BrockSilverCapAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "That Silver Bottle Cap brings one\n",
        "of a Pokémon’s stats to its peak.\r",
        "A strong team is built like a\n",
        "mountain: one solid layer at a\f",
        "time. Choose wisely!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_PewterCity_Gym_Text_DontHaveRoomForThis",
      "en_US": "You don’t have room for this."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_GymHack_Text_GiftSentToPC",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Bag is full, so the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} was sent to your PC."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_rock",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You made it!\r",
        "Your Rock types have gotten solid\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Two Rock Gyms in Kanto?\n",
        "I can’t wait!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_normal",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Good to see you again,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\r",
        "Your Normal types fought well.\n",
        "Basics win battles. Stick with it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_water",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Hmph. So the kid from\n",
        "Oak’s lab made it all the way here.\r",
        "Your Water Pokémon are good.\n",
        "Annoyingly good.\r",
        "There’s still only room for One\n",
        "Water Gym in Kanto!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_electric",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Well, well! The Electric\n",
        "kid from Oak’s lab!\r",
        "You’ve got a spark, I’ll give you\n",
        "that. But this is still my turf!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_steel",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: The Steel kid from\n",
        "Oak’s lab! Your team held up under\f",
        "fire.\r",
        "Still don’t buy a Steel Gym in\n",
        "Pallet, though!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_grass",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! It’s so nice\n",
        "to see you again.\r",
        "Your Grass Pokémon have grown so\n",
        "much since we met at Oak’s lab."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_poison",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: …So. The child from Oak’s\n",
        "lab grows stronger.\r",
        "I have watched you. I still will\n",
        "not make it easy for a rival."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_bug",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! You’ve come far\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Your Bug Pokémon surprised even\n",
        "me. A little."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_psychic",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: …As I foresaw at Oak’s\n",
        "lab, you came.\r",
        "I still do not like a second\n",
        "Psychic Gym. But visions do not\f",
        "ask for permission."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_fairy",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: We meet again, as I said\n",
        "we would.\r",
        "Your Fairy Pokémon trust you\n",
        "completely. That is rare."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_fire",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! My favorite Fire\n",
        "trainer! Quiz! Who knew you’d make\f",
        "it this far?\r",
        "Answer: me! Wahahahah!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_GymCandidate_Text_SomeoneToSeeYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm? Someone came into the Gym\n",
        "looking for {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_GymCandidate_Text_NotYet",
      "en_US": [
        "Come back when you’re ready.\n",
        "My Gym isn’t going anywhere."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_GymCandidate_Text_TeamBreaksRules",
      "en_US": [
        "Hold on. A Gym Leader battles with\n",
        "one type, and no two alike.\r",
        "Fix your team first, then\n",
        "come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_GymCandidate_Text_GuardItemExplain",
      "en_US": [
        "When a Pokémon holds the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, no move is\f",
        "super effective against it.\r",
        "It never wears out."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_GymCandidate_Text_EdgeItemExplain",
      "en_US": [
        "When a Pokémon holds the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, its moves always\f",
        "hit for at least normal damage.\r",
        "It never wears out."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_Outfits_Text_ReceivedGymUniform",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received a\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} Gym Uniform!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_Outfits_Text_PutInWardrobe",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} put it in the wardrobe\n",
        "upstairs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_Text_GymHack_WrongType",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: Only {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}-type\n",
        "Pokémon may be on your team.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}-type!\r",
        "Leave it in a PC and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_Text_GymHack_Duplicate",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: No two Pokémon on\n",
        "your team may be the same species.\r",
        "You have more than one\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Leave one in a PC and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0462_T03GYM0101_Text_GymHack_DuplicateItem",
      "en_US": [
        "League Rules: No two Pokémon on\n",
